' v1.2's marks on labels (`MapViewOverlayHoverText`, `GuiTextBars`;
' `preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30 party give item_rat_trap`,
' the companion camped at Paradise Camp and the rat trap laid in the tent, as
' v12_production_choice prepares it). The mouse over the mercenary (record
' 106, nobody's): his tier as dots. In the place, Tab's targets: a
' character's label shows his experience tier as dots, and for the
' player's own people his health in seven steps; a door of the player's own
' camp what its room holds and the trap there. On the world map, by keyboard,
' the camp's label on half-black: its people, its food a day, the trap and
' the water.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
pointon 106              ' the mercenary, nobody's: his tier
wait 2
snap nobodys
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
uiclick 168,248          ' the rat trap put down
wait 5
esc
wait 10
press tab                ' the nearest targets, one after another
wait 3
snap target1
press tab
wait 3
snap target2
press tab
wait 3
snap target3
press tab
wait 3
snap target4
esc                      ' the world map
wait 20
press right
wait 3
press left               ' back to the camp
wait 3
snap camp_label
quit
